<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine average wage rises 6.4 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Ukraine average wage rises 6.4 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukrainian average wages rose 6.4 percent in March to 147.73 hryvnia, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE AVERAGE WAGES	Mar 97	Feb 97	Mar 96</p>
<p>    average wage (hryvnia)     147.73	138.90	129.33</p>
<p>    pct change mth/mth	    +6.4	  -0.4	  +6.9</p>
<p>    pct change from Jan 1	 -9.8	 -15.1	   n/a</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
</text>
